stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> ClarificationRequired: 关键信息不足
    [*] --> AwaitingConfirmation: 信息足够或采用可见默认值
    ClarificationRequired --> ClarificationRequired: 补充后仍不足
    ClarificationRequired --> AwaitingConfirmation: 补充后足够
    AwaitingConfirmation --> AwaitingConfirmation: 用户修改目标
    AwaitingConfirmation --> Confirmed: 用户明确确认
    ClarificationRequired --> Cancelled: 用户取消
    AwaitingConfirmation --> Cancelled: 用户取消
    Confirmed --> AgentRunPending: 同一事务创建 Run
    AgentRunPending --> [*]
    Cancelled --> [*]

    note right of AwaitingConfirmation
      LLM 只能抽取目标字段
      不能代替用户确认
    end note

    note right of AgentRunPending
      生成 1–8 周总体路线
      展开滚动未来 7 天任务
    end note
